                                "sense_id": "cf870511-bfb8-34e5-867d-dccba73b8c4b",
                                "text": "And when I roſe in the moꝛning to giue my childe ſucke, behold, it was dead: but when I had conſidered it in the moꝛning, beholde, it was not my ſonne, which I did beare."
