                                "sense_id": "cf870511-bfb8-34e5-867d-dccba73b8c4b",
                                "text": "19th century, Jean Ingelow - The Brides of Enderby\nShe moved where Lindis wandereth,\nMy sonne's faire wife, Elizabeth."
